# Vocabulary audit — {{CLIENT_NAME}}

Every organisation names the same real-world thing differently by function — **and frequently at different grains**, which is why integrations break weekly and nobody can find the cause.

**Their words are the asset.** Do not normalise into industry-standard terms without logging it as a decision with a named approver.

